# PLAY tests read its source as text with plain line endings; Windows checkouts (core.autocrlf=true) turned them into CRLF
# and broke those tests (audit A12, 20 Nov 2026). PLAY files stay LF on every checkout; binary engines are left alone.
play/**/*.js text eol=lf
play/**/*.html text eol=lf
play/**/*.css text eol=lf
play/**/*.json text eol=lf
play/**/*.md text eol=lf
play/**/*.wasm binary
play/**/*.gz binary
